# ---------------------------------------------------------------- video build
# Everything below is REGENERATED by the demo/ scripts. It stays on disk so the
# video can be re-cut without a full rebuild, but it is output, not source, and
# does not belong in the repository:
#
#   python demo/facts.py           -> frames/facts.json
#   python demo/build_frames.py    -> frames/*.html, narration.json, SCRIPT.md
#   python demo/render_scenes.py   -> clips/*.mp4
#   python demo/make_video.py      -> frames/*.png, the narration, the .mp4
demo/frames/
demo/clips/
demo/ring-sentinel-pitch.mp4
demo/ring-sentinel-pitch.ass
demo/_segments/
